Practical 4 : Sorting and Searching in Arrays

• Write a program to sort an array alphabetically.
• Demonstrate sorting of numeric arrays

code :- 

# Program to sort an array alphabetically
fruits = ["Mango", "Apple", "Banana", "Orange", "Grapes"]
print("Original array:", fruits)
fruits.sort()
print("Alphabetically sorted array:", fruits)
In descending order 
fruits.sort(reverse=True)
